attorneys.bio:
Phil has been helping the injured and disabled for over seven years. Over the course of his career, Phil has successfully recovered over $10 million in judgments, settlements, and awards for his clients. These clients have included:

The victim of a bar altercation who received $225,000 for his injuries;

$199,000 for a gentleman who slipped and fell on ice outside of a convenience store;

An individual hit by an oncoming truck who received $175,000 for his injuries;

$166,000 for a kind lady injured in a motor vehicle collision;

A minor child involved in a motor vehicle collision who received $150,000 for his injuries;

Secured $150,000 for an individual injured on the premises of a landscaper;

A high school student who received $125,000 after being run over after a school function ($50,000 from the driver and $75,000 from the school);

In addition, Phil has represented workers injured in workplace accidents, and has secured settlements of $200,000 or more on numerous occasions. Phil has tried many workers' compensation cases, including those for individuals who are permanently and totally disabled. Phil's representation of injured workers extends beyond workers' compensation, and into the realm of personal injury, social security, and discrimination.

